      "content": "The feeling of your true self being erased is a profound kind of grief, and it's completely understandable why you feel disconnected from your body. This sense of a fractured identity suggests a deep internal struggle that needs careful attention. Please consider speaking with a therapist who specializes in existential or identity issues, as they can offer a space to explore these complex feelings. You don't have to navigate this crushing weight entirely alone.",
      "source": "target",
